\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces The bear in the woods, traced in order of arrival. The timings are approximate and are drawn largely from animal work; what matters is not the numbers but the ordering, and in particular that the autonomic response is complete before the feeling of fear has been assembled and long before the endocrine response has arrived.}}{72}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
